[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the plug and drain the manual gearbox and differential.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the manual gearbox and\ndifferential oil in a suitable container.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044577.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the right differential internal driveshaft using a special\nlever.</p><p>2. Remove the right differential shaft oil seal.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Take care not to damage the oil\nseal seat during removal.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044578.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit a new right differential shaft oil seal (1a) using the tools\n(1b) and (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Grip</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.007.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.630.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Place the right differential internal driveshaft in its housing.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044579.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Tighten the manual gearbox and differential fluid drain plug\nto the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Drain plug</p></td><td><p>GEAR CASING PADS</p></td><td><p>M16</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Differential side) 1.6 ÷ 2.0</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044580.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Refill the manual gearbox and differential \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428827\">0010T41</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]